Slayer vs Slayer
- Engage in Slayer vs Slayer combat across various maps.
- Win 5 rounds to claim victory.
- Farm AI fodder demons and utilize map pickups for resources.

Co-operative Mode
- Play various maps with friends.
- Slayers are fully loaded and should work together to complete combat encounters.
- At least one player should select a Slayer on the left podium slot.

Invasion Mode
- Play campaign maps with Demon Players hunting the Slayer.
- The Slayer must complete all combat encounters.
- The Demons must kill the Slayer.
